<!-- Story Section -->
<section class="section bg-soft" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
  <div class="container container-sm">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
      <h2 id="story-heading">Born from Frustration, Built with Purpose</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-prose">
      <p>Our founders experienced firsthand how inaccessible quality mock test content was for students outside tier-1 cities. Expensive coaching institutes, outdated question banks, and zero performance feedback created an uneven playing field.</p>
      <p>MockOrbit was built to fix this. By combining expert-crafted content with intelligent analytics, we created a platform that gives every aspirant — whether in Delhi or a small town in Rajasthan — the same competitive edge.</p>
      <p>Today, we work with <strong>150+ partner institutes</strong> and serve students preparing for over <strong>20 competitive exams</strong>. Our AI-powered weak-area reports have helped thousands understand exactly where to focus, turning average performers into rank holders.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Values Section -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">What We Stand For</span>
      <h2 id="values-heading">Our Core Values</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎯</div>
        <h3>Accuracy First</h3>
        <p>Every question is reviewed by subject experts and cross-checked against the latest exam notifications. No outdated content, no guesswork.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔍</div>
        <h3>Full Transparency</h3>
        <p>We show you exactly where you stand — your rank, percentile, section-wise scores, and comparison with top performers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</div>
        <h3>Genuine Support</h3>
        <p>Real humans respond to your queries within 24 hours. Our team includes educators who understand the anxiety of competitive exam preparation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">💡</div>
        <h3>Continuous Improvement</h3>
        <p>We regularly update our question bank and analytics based on changing exam patterns and student feedback.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

